        "Content": "•Country location, yet only short drive to Maynooth, Leixlip and Celbridge.\n•Stunning spacious gardens.\n•Unfurnished.\n•Detached garage.\n•Available Immediately \n\nThis stunning property features an inviting entrance hall, a modern kitchen with a breakfast bar and a spacious dining area, and a large living room with an adjacent home office. Additional amenities include a utility room and a guest W.C. Upstairs, you`ll find three bedrooms, with the master boasting two walk-in wardrobes. The main bathroom includes a separate shower, while a second bathroom services the other two bedrooms.\n\n\nOutside, enjoy a large, beautifully maintained garden (the landlord will take care of garden maintenance) and a detached garage with a deep freeze. \n\nThe property is available immediately.\n\nEmail enquiries only please."
